%% Status: CURRENT — live source verified
sequenceDiagram
  participant UI
  participant Fn as feedback-submit
  participant Auth as Supabase Auth
  participant DB as feedback
  participant Bucket as feedback-messages
  UI->>Fn: bearer token + category/message/bounded context
  Fn->>Auth: verify caller
  Auth-->>Fn: user id
  Fn->>DB: insert user-owned row
  Fn->>Bucket: write private user-prefixed text mirror
  Fn-->>UI: 200 or 207 partial-storage result
  Note over DB,Bucket: Reads are admin-only via app_metadata role.
